Bundled third-party components
------------------------------
The Python wheel contains only this project's code and its data files; the following
dependencies are installed separately by the package manager:

- PyYAML (MIT License)
- Jinja2 (BSD 3-Clause License)
- NumPy (BSD 3-Clause License)

The Windows/Linux "green package" additionally bundles CPython (PSF License) and the
PyInstaller bootloader and runtime (GPL-2.0-or-later with the PyInstaller bootloader
exception, which permits distributing bundled applications under any license).

Literature references
---------------------
The files under `src/fblockkit/knowledge/` (sources.bib and the rule tables) cite
published works. Those entries are bibliographic references, not incorporated text;
the tool prints the complete citation and a paste-ready BibTeX entry for every
reference it uses.

External algorithms
-------------------
Methodological protocols implemented here were re-derived from their published
descriptions. No code from GPL-licensed or unlicensed software is linked, copied or
redistributed; the tool index (`src/fblockkit/knowledge/toolindex/tools.yaml`) records
the relation and status of every external tool that appears in this project's scope.
